msgid "## 6 Functional Verification"
msgstr "## 6 功能验证"

msgid ""
"Replace `{ip}` and `{port}` with the service endpoint. All examples use "
"`minimax-m3.1-flash` as the served model name."
msgstr "将 `{ip}` 和 `{port}` 替换为服务端点。所有示例均使用 `minimax-m3.1-flash` 作为服务模型名称。"

msgid "### 6.1 Text"
msgstr "### 6.1 文本"

msgid "Expected result: the answer is C."
msgstr "预期结果：答案为 C。"

msgid "### 6.2 Single Image"
msgstr "### 6.2 单图"

msgid ""
"Start the service with image input enabled, for example `--limit-mm-per-"
"prompt '{\"image\":1,\"video\":0}'`. Replace `${IMAGE_PATH}` with a local "
"image path on the client side."
msgstr ""
"启动服务并启用图像输入，例如 `--limit-mm-per-prompt '{\"image\":1,\"video\":0}'`。在客户端将 "
"`${IMAGE_PATH}` 替换为本地图像路径。"

msgid ""
"Expected result: HTTP 200 response with a JSON body containing non-empty "
"`choices` and generated text describing the image."
msgstr "预期结果：HTTP 200 响应，JSON 响应体中包含非空的 `choices`，以及描述该图像的生成文本。"

msgid "### 6.3 Single Video"
msgstr "### 6.3 单视频"

msgid ""
"Start the service with video input enabled, for example `--limit-mm-per-"
"prompt '{\"image\":0,\"video\":1}'`. If the request uses `file://` local "
"video paths, also add `--allowed-local-media-path /` or a narrower allowed "
"directory. If `media_io_kwargs.video.num_frames` is not specified, vLLM "
"samples 32 frames by default."
msgstr ""
"启动服务并启用视频输入，例如 `--limit-mm-per-prompt '{\"image\":0,\"video\":1}'`。如果请求使用 "
"`file://` 本地视频路径，还需添加 `--allowed-local-media-path /` 或范围更窄的允许目录。如果未指定 "
"`media_io_kwargs.video.num_frames`，vLLM 默认采样 32 帧。"

msgid ""
"Expected result: HTTP 200 response with a JSON body containing non-empty "
"`choices` and generated text describing the video content."
msgstr "预期结果：HTTP 200 响应，JSON 响应体中包含非空的 `choices`，以及描述该视频内容的生成文本。"

msgid "### 6.4 Mixed Image and Video Request"
msgstr "### 6.4 图文视频混合请求"

msgid ""
"Start the service with both image and video input enabled. For the following"
" request, use `--limit-mm-per-prompt '{\"image\":1,\"video\":1}'`. If the "
"request uses `file://` local video paths, also add `--allowed-local-media-"
"path /` or a narrower allowed directory."
msgstr ""
"启动服务并同时启用图像和视频输入。对于以下请求，使用 `--limit-mm-per-prompt "
"'{\"image\":1,\"video\":1}'`。如果请求使用 `file://` 本地视频路径，还需添加 `--allowed-local-"
"media-path /` 或范围更窄的允许目录。"

msgid ""
"Expected result: HTTP 200 response with a JSON body containing non-empty "
"`choices` and generated text that describes the image and video separately "
"and explains whether they are related."
msgstr "预期结果：HTTP 200 响应，JSON 响应体中包含非空的 `choices`，以及分别描述图像和视频并说明二者是否相关的生成文本。"

