msgid "## 9 Performance Tuning"
msgstr "## 9 性能调优"

msgid "### 9.1 Recommended Configurations"
msgstr "### 9.1 推荐配置"

msgid ""
"Use the commands in [Section 5](#5-online-service-deployment) as starting "
"configurations. They are not globally optimal: the appropriate settings "
"depend on request lengths, concurrency, prefix-cache hit rate, and the "
"available device memory. Evaluate each adjustment with the same workload and"
" compare latency, throughput, and memory use."
msgstr ""
"可将[第 5 节](#5-online-service-"
"deployment)中的命令作为起始配置。这些配置并非全局最优：合适的设置取决于请求长度、并发度、前缀缓存命中率以及可用的设备内存。请使用相同的工作负载评估每次调整，并比较时延、吞吐量和内存占用。"

msgid ""
"| Scenario | Starting Configuration | Parameters to Evaluate | Validation |"
msgstr "| 场景 | 起始配置 | 待评估参数 | 验证方法 |"

msgid ""
"| Low latency | Single-node examples in Section 5.1. | Reduce request "
"concurrency and compare `--max-num-seqs` and `--max-num-batched-tokens` "
"settings. | Compare TTFT and TPOT alongside output-token throughput. |"
msgstr ""
"| 低时延 | 第 5.1 节中的单节点示例。 | 降低请求并发度，并比较 `--max-num-seqs` 和 `--max-num-batched-"
"tokens` 设置。 | 在比较输出 token 吞吐量的同时比较 TTFT 和 TPOT。 |"

msgid ""
"| High throughput | PD examples in Section 5.3. | Adjust `MAX_NUM_SEQS` and "
"`MAX_BATCHED_TOKENS` on Prefill and Decode separately while keeping both "
"connector topology declarations consistent. | Increase offered load "
"gradually and check throughput, latency, and failed requests. |"
msgstr ""
"| 高吞吐 | 第 5.3 节中的 PD 示例。 | 分别调整 Prefill 和 Decode 的 `MAX_NUM_SEQS` 和 "
"`MAX_BATCHED_TOKENS`，同时保持两处 connector 拓扑声明一致。 | 逐步增加施加的负载，并检查吞吐量、时延和失败请求。 |"

msgid "### 9.2 Tuning Guidelines"
msgstr "### 9.2 调优指南"

msgid ""
"The examples explicitly enable FlashComm1 and seven-token DSpark. On 950DT "
"products, the PD main model uses FP8 KV cache while the DSpark draft uses "
"BF16 KV cache. Preserve that distinction when tuning; the draft cache dtype "
"is configured inside `--speculative-config`."
msgstr ""
"示例中显式启用了 FlashComm1 和七 token 的 DSpark。在 Ascend 950DT系列产品上，PD 主模型使用 FP8 KV "
"缓存，而 DSpark draft 使用 BF16 KV 缓存。调优时请保持这一区别；draft 缓存的数据类型在 `--speculative-"
"config` 中配置。"

msgid ""
"Change one parameter at a time and retain the command and benchmark result "
"for each run. For general methods, refer to [Optimization and "
"Tuning](../../developer_guide/performance_and_debug/optimization_and_tuning.md)."
" For feature descriptions and configuration constraints, refer to the "
"[Feature Matrix](../../user_guide/support_matrix/feature_matrix.md) and "
"[Speculative Decoding "
"Guide](../../user_guide/feature_guide/speculative_decoding.md#speculating-"
"using-dspark)."
msgstr ""
"每次只更改一个参数，并保留每次运行的命令和基准测试结果。通用方法请参考[优化与调优](../../developer_guide/performance_and_debug/optimization_and_tuning.md)。特性说明和配置约束请参考[特性矩阵](../../user_guide/support_matrix/feature_matrix.md)和[投机推理指南](../../user_guide/feature_guide/speculative_decoding.md#speculating-"
"using-dspark)。"

msgid "## 10 FAQ"
msgstr "## 10 常见问题"

msgid ""
"For common environment, installation, and general parameter issues, refer to"
" the [Public FAQs](../../faqs.md). This section covers MiniMax-M3.1-Flash-"
"specific deployment issues."
msgstr ""
"有关常见环境、安装和通用参数问题，请参考[公共常见问题](../../faqs.md)。本节介绍 MiniMax-M3.1-Flash 特有的部署问题。"

msgid "### 10.1 DSpark Draft Initialization Fails with FP8 KV Cache"
msgstr "### 10.1 使用 FP8 KV 缓存时 DSpark Draft 初始化失败"

msgid ""
"**Symptom:** A 950DT products PD service fails while initializing the DSpark"
" draft because FP8 KV quantization parameters are missing."
msgstr ""
"**现象：** Ascend 950DT系列产品上的 PD 服务在初始化 DSpark draft 时因缺少 FP8 KV 量化参数而失败。"

msgid ""
"**Cause:** The draft inherits the main model's FP8 KV cache configuration "
"unless a draft cache dtype is specified."
msgstr "**原因：** 如果未指定 draft 缓存数据类型，draft 会继承主模型的 FP8 KV 缓存配置。"

msgid ""
"**Resolution:** Keep the main-model argument `--kv-cache-dtype fp8`, and set"
" `kv_cache_dtype` to `bfloat16` inside `--speculative-config` on both "
"Prefill and Decode:"
msgstr ""
"**解决方法：** 保留主模型参数 `--kv-cache-dtype fp8`，并在 Prefill 和 Decode 两端的 "
"`--speculative-config` 中将 `kv_cache_dtype` 设置为 `bfloat16`："

msgid ""
"The scripts in Section 5.3 already include this setting. It changes only the"
" draft KV cache dtype."
msgstr "第 5.3 节中的脚本已包含此设置。它仅更改 draft KV 缓存的 dtype。"

msgid "### 10.2 Model Loading Is Still in Progress or Startup Fails"
msgstr "### 10.2 模型仍在加载中或启动失败"

msgid ""
"**Symptom:** The API is not ready while loading the approximately "
"428B-parameter checkpoint or capturing graphs."
msgstr "**现象：** 在加载约 428B 参数的 checkpoint 或捕获图时，API 尚未就绪。"

msgid ""
"**Cause:** Weight loading, initialization, and graph capture depend on "
"storage speed, the hardware, and the selected configuration. Elapsed time "
"alone does not distinguish ongoing initialization from a failure."
msgstr "**原因：** 权重加载、初始化和图捕获取决于存储速度、硬件以及所选配置。仅凭耗时无法区分正在进行的初始化与故障。"

msgid ""
"**Resolution:** Follow the foreground logs for single-node deployment. For "
"PD deployment, use `tail -f prefill.log` on Prefill; use `tail -f "
"decode-0.log decode-1.log decode-2.log decode-3.log` on A3 D1 and `tail -f "
"decode-4.log decode-5.log decode-6.log decode-7.log` on A3 D2; use `tail -f "
"decode.log` on each 950DT products Decode node. Allow initialization to "
"continue while logs show progress. Send requests or start the PD proxy after"
" every required service prints `Application startup complete`; the single-"
"node health check must return `200`."
msgstr ""
"**解决方法：** 单机部署时跟踪前台日志。PD 部署时，在 Prefill 上使用 `tail -f prefill.log`；在 A3 D1 上使用"
" `tail -f decode-0.log decode-1.log decode-2.log decode-3.log`，在 A3 D2 上使用 "
"`tail -f decode-4.log decode-5.log decode-6.log decode-7.log`；在每个 Ascend "
"950DT系列产品 Decode 节点上使用 `tail -f decode.log`。只要日志显示有进展，就允许初始化继续进行。待所有必需服务打印 "
"`Application startup complete` 后再发送请求或启动 PD 代理；单机健康检查必须返回 `200`。"

msgid ""
"If logs stop progressing or the process exits, inspect the first error in "
"every affected role log. Check that `MODEL_PATH` points to the matching "
"weight variant mounted in Section 4, confirm the expected devices are "
"visible with `npu-smi info`, and compare the actual startup command with the"
" corresponding platform example. For PD communication failures, also recheck"
" `LOCAL_IP`, `NIC_NAME`, and [inter-node connectivity](#32-verify-multi-"
"node-communication). For memory errors, review the context budget and "
"concurrency described in [Section 5](#5-online-service-deployment) and the "
"[out-of-memory FAQ](../../faqs.md#12-how-to-handle-the-out-of-memory-issue)."
msgstr ""
"如果日志停止推进或进程退出，请检查每个受影响角色日志中的首个错误。检查 `MODEL_PATH` 是否指向第 4 节中挂载的匹配权重变体，使用 "
"`npu-smi info` 确认预期设备可见，并将实际启动命令与对应平台示例进行比对。对于 PD 通信故障，还需重新检查 "
"`LOCAL_IP`、`NIC_NAME` 以及[节点间连通性](#32-verify-multi-node-"
"communication)。对于内存错误，请查阅[第 5 节](#5-online-service-"
"deployment)中描述的上下文预算与并发设置，以及[内存不足常见问题](../../faqs.md#12-how-to-handle-the-"
"out-of-memory-issue)。"

msgid "# MiniMax-M3.1-Flash"
msgstr "# MiniMax-M3.1-Flash"

msgid ""
"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash is supported on the vLLM Ascend `main` branch and in "
"`v0.32.0rc`. This guide is written based on the `main` branch. Use the "
"deployment image for your hardware from [Installation](#4-installation)."
msgstr ""
"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash 在 vLLM Ascend `main` 分支和 `v0.32.0rc` 中受支持。本指南基于 `main` "
"分支编写。请从[安装](#4-installation)章节中选择适用于您硬件的部署镜像。"

msgid ""
"The features described below are those enabled by the deployment commands in"
" this guide. Refer to [Supported Features](#2-supported-features) for the "
"model support matrix."
msgstr "下文描述的功能均为本指南中部署命令所启用的功能。模型支持矩阵请参阅[支持的特性](#2-supported-features)。"

msgid ""
"| MiniMax-M3.1-Flash-W8A8 | Atlas 800I A2, two-node PD colocation <br> Atlas"
" 800I A3, single-node deployment or three-host PD disaggregation (1P1D, "
"Decode spans two hosts) | [ModelScope](https://www.modelscope.cn/models/Eco-"
"Tech/Minimax-M3.1-Flash-w8a8) |"
msgstr ""
"| MiniMax-M3.1-Flash-W8A8 | Atlas 800I A2，双节点 PD 混部 <br> Atlas 800I "
"A3，单节点部署或三主机 PD 分离（1P1D，Decode 跨两台主机） | "
"[ModelScope](https://www.modelscope.cn/models/Eco-"
"Tech/Minimax-M3.1-Flash-w8a8) |"

msgid ""
"| MiniMax-M3.1-Flash-MXFP8 | 950DT products, single-node deployment or "
"three-host PD disaggregation (1P1D, Decode spans two hosts) | "
"[ModelScope](https://www.modelscope.cn/models/Eco-"
"Tech/Minimax-M3.1-Flash-w8a8-mxfp8) |"
msgstr ""
"| MiniMax-M3.1-Flash-MXFP8 | Ascend 950DT系列产品，单节点部署或三主机 PD 分离（1P1D，Decode "
"跨两台主机） | [ModelScope](https://www.modelscope.cn/models/Eco-"
"Tech/Minimax-M3.1-Flash-w8a8-mxfp8) |"

msgid "### 4.1 Docker Image Installation"
msgstr "### 4.1 Docker 镜像安装"

msgid ""
"Choose the tab for your hardware and run the commands on each participating "
"host."
msgstr "请选择适用于您硬件的标签页，并在每台参与的主机上运行相应命令。"

msgid ""
"| 1M PD disaggregation, A3 ([Section 5.5](#55-1m-token-context-deployment)) "
"| 1050624 |"
msgstr "| 1M PD 分离，A3（[第 5.5 节](#55-1m-token-context-deployment)） | 1050624 |"

msgid ""
"Single-node deployment runs Prefill and Decode on the same host. The A3 "
"example uses W8A8 weights on all 16 NPUs, and the 950DT products example "
"uses W8A8-MXFP8 weights on all eight NPUs. Both use [DSpark speculative "
"decoding](../../user_guide/feature_guide/speculative_decoding.md#speculating-"
"using-dspark), which generates draft tokens and verifies them with the "
"target model."
msgstr ""
"单节点部署在同一台主机上运行 Prefill 和 Decode。A3 示例在全部 16 个 NPU 上使用 W8A8 权重，Ascend "
"950DT系列产品示例在全部 8 个 NPU 上使用 W8A8-MXFP8 权重。两者均使用 [DSpark "
"投机解码](../../user_guide/feature_guide/speculative_decoding.md#speculating-"
"using-dspark)，该功能生成草稿 token 并由目标模型进行验证。"

msgid ""
"Run the following inside the A3 container. It starts one API service with "
"DP4 × TP4 / EP16 across all 16 NPUs, using W8A8 weights and DSpark "
"speculative decoding with seven draft tokens."
msgstr ""
"在 A3 容器内运行以下命令。它会在全部 16 个 NPU 上以 DP4 × TP4 / EP16 启动一个 API 服务，使用 W8A8 权重和带 7"
" 个草稿 token 的 DSpark 投机解码。"

msgid ""
"Set `MODEL_PATH` to your model weight directory; the following example uses "
"the container mount path configured in [Section 4](#4-installation). Set "
"`HCCL_IF_IP` to the communication IP of the current host, that is, the IP "
"used as `LOCAL_IP` in [Section 3.2](#32-verify-multi-node-communication)."
msgstr ""
"将 `MODEL_PATH` 设置为您的模型权重目录；以下示例使用[第 4 节](#4-installation)中配置的容器挂载路径。将 "
"`HCCL_IF_IP` 设置为当前主机的通信 IP，即[第 3.2 节](#32-verify-multi-node-"
"communication)中用作 `LOCAL_IP` 的 IP。"

msgid ""
"Run the following inside the 950DT products container. It uses DP2 × TP4 / "
"EP8 across all eight NPUs, W8A8-MXFP8 weights, and DSpark speculative "
"decoding with seven draft tokens."
msgstr ""
"在 Ascend 950DT系列产品容器内运行以下命令。它在全部 8 个 NPU 上使用 DP2 × TP4 / EP8、W8A8-MXFP8 "
"权重，以及带 7 个草稿 token 的 DSpark 投机解码。"

msgid ""
"Multi-node deployment spreads one data-parallel group across multiple hosts."
" Every host runs Prefill and Decode in the same engine instance (PD "
"colocation), and the hosts join one distributed group. Both nodes use DSpark"
" speculative decoding with seven draft tokens. Configure the host-specific "
"values at the beginning of each node script before starting the service."
msgstr ""
"多节点部署将一个数据并行组分布到多台主机上。每台主机在同一个引擎实例中运行 Prefill 和 Decode（PD "
"混部），各主机加入同一个分布式组。两个节点均使用带 7 个草稿 token 的 DSpark "
"投机解码。启动服务前，请在每个节点脚本的开头配置各主机特定的值。"

msgid "| Role | API server | Headless worker |"
msgstr "| 角色 | API 服务器 | 无头工作节点 |"

msgid "| DP × TP | 2 × 4 | 2 × 4 |"
msgstr "| DP × TP | 2 × 4 | 2 × 4 |"

msgid "### 5.3 PD Disaggregation (1P1D)"
msgstr "### 5.3 PD 分离（1P1D）"

msgid ""
"Both platforms use a 1P1D topology: one Prefill service on one host and one "
"distributed Decode service spanning two hosts. The two Decode hosts share "
"one global data-parallel group; D1 and D2 identify physical hosts within "
"that service. Multiple Decode API endpoints represent ranks or local rank "
"groups within the same distributed service. Prefill processes the prompt, "
"Decode generates tokens, and a proxy forwards requests between them while "
"Mooncake transfers the KV cache. For the general workflow, refer to "
"[Mooncake](../features/pd_disaggregation_mooncake_multi_node.md). Both "
"platforms use DSpark speculative decoding with seven draft tokens. Configure"
" the host-specific values at the beginning of each Prefill and Decode script"
" before starting the service."
msgstr ""
"两个平台均采用 1P1D 拓扑：一台主机上运行一个 Prefill 服务，一个分布式 Decode 服务跨两台主机。两台 Decode "
"主机共享一个全局数据并行组；D1 和 D2 标识该服务内的物理主机。多个 Decode API 端点代表同一分布式服务内的 rank 或本地 rank "
"组。Prefill 处理提示词，Decode 生成 token，代理在两者之间转发请求，同时由 Mooncake 传输 KV 缓存。通用工作流程请参阅 "
"[Mooncake](../features/pd_disaggregation_mooncake_multi_node.md)。两个平台均使用带 7 "
"个草稿 token 的 DSpark 投机解码。启动服务前，请在每个 Prefill 和 Decode 脚本的开头配置各主机特定的值。"

msgid ""
"Start Prefill, D1, and D2 within a few seconds of each other, and start the "
"proxy only after every engine prints `Application startup complete`. Do not "
"wait for one role to become ready before starting the next: a role that is "
"still missing blocks the distributed rendezvous, and the roles started "
"earlier fail when `VLLM_ENGINE_READY_TIMEOUT_S` expires before the group is "
"complete."
msgstr ""
"请在数秒内相继启动 Prefill、D1 和 D2，并且仅当所有引擎都打印出 `Application startup complete` "
"后再启动代理。不要等待某个角色就绪后再启动下一个角色：仍缺失的角色会阻塞分布式会合，而如果 `VLLM_ENGINE_READY_TIMEOUT_S` "
"在组完成之前超时，先启动的角色将会失败。"

msgid ""
"Monitor the role logs while weights load and graph capture completes. "
"Startup duration depends on storage, hardware, and the selected "
"configuration; use continuing log progress to monitor initialization, and "
"wait for `Application startup complete` on every HTTP-serving instance to "
"judge readiness. If logs stop progressing or report an error, follow "
"[Startup Troubleshooting](#102-model-loading-is-still-in-progress-or-"
"startup-fails) before starting the proxy."
msgstr ""
"在权重加载和图捕获完成期间监控各角色的日志。启动时长取决于存储、硬件和所选配置；请通过日志是否持续输出来监控初始化进度，并以每个提供 HTTP "
"服务的实例都打印出 `Application startup complete` "
"作为就绪判断依据。如果日志停止输出或报告错误，请先按照[启动故障排查](#102-model-loading-is-still-in-progress-"
"or-startup-fails)处理，再启动代理。"

msgid "**A3 series (W8A8) deployment configuration**"
msgstr "**A3 系列（W8A8）部署配置**"

msgid ""
"Use one Prefill host and two hosts for the distributed Decode service "
"(1P1D), each with all 16 NPUs and the W8A8 weights. Prefill uses DP1 × TP4 ×"
" PP4. Decode uses one global DP8 × TP4 × PP1 group across the two hosts: D1 "
"runs global DP ranks 0–3 and D2 runs ranks 4–7, and each rank starts one TP4"
" replica on four local NPUs. Every Decode rank exposes its own HTTP API, and"
" the proxy registers all eight Decode endpoints. Use the same image and "
"weights on all three hosts."
msgstr ""
"使用一台 Prefill 主机和两台主机用于分布式 Decode 服务（1P1D），每台主机均使用全部 16 个 NPU 和 W8A8 "
"权重。Prefill 使用 DP1 × TP4 × PP4。Decode 在两台主机上使用一个全局 DP8 × TP4 × PP1 组：D1 运行全局 "
"DP rank 0–3，D2 运行 rank 4–7，每个 rank 在四个本地 NPU 上启动一个 TP4 副本。每个 Decode rank "
"都暴露自己的 HTTP API，代理注册全部 8 个 Decode 端点。三台主机使用相同的镜像和权重。"

msgid "| DP × TP × PP | 1 × 4 × 4 | 8 × 4 × 1 across two nodes |"
msgstr "| DP × TP × PP | 1 × 4 × 4 | 跨两个节点 8 × 4 × 1 |"

msgid "| Execution mode | Eager | FULL_DECODE_ONLY |"
msgstr "| 执行模式 | Eager | FULL_DECODE_ONLY |"

msgid "**950DT products deployment configuration**"
msgstr "**Ascend 950DT系列产品部署配置**"

msgid ""
"Use one Prefill host and two hosts for the distributed Decode service "
"(1P1D), each with all eight NPUs and the W8A8-MXFP8 weights. Prefill uses "
"DP1 × TP4 × PP2. The two Decode hosts form one global DP4 × TP4 × PP1 / EP16"
" group with two local DP ranks per host: D1 runs ranks 0–1 and D2 runs ranks"
" 2–3. Both Decode hosts serve the HTTP API and are registered separately as "
"proxy endpoints, so do not add `--headless` to the D2 script. The verified "
"configuration uses `--data-parallel-size-local 2` on both hosts and `--data-"
"parallel-start-rank 2` on D2. Each host exposes one API endpoint serving its"
" two local DP ranks; retaining the API on D2 does not change its local DP "
"size. D1 is the Data Parallel master and the two Decode scripts must use the"
" same `DECODE_HEAD_IP`, DP RPC port, and KV port."
msgstr ""
"使用一台 Prefill 主机和两台主机部署分布式 Decode 服务（1P1D），每台主机均使用全部八个 NPU 和 W8A8-MXFP8 "
"权重。Prefill 使用 DP1 × TP4 × PP2。两台 Decode 主机组成一个全局 DP4 × TP4 × PP1 / EP16 "
"组，每台主机有两个本地 DP rank：D1 运行 rank 0–1，D2 运行 rank 2–3。两台 Decode 主机均提供 HTTP "
"API，并分别注册为代理端点，因此不要在 D2 脚本中添加 `--headless`。已验证的配置在两台主机上均使用 `--data-parallel-"
"size-local 2`，并在 D2 上使用 `--data-parallel-start-rank 2`。每台主机暴露一个 API "
"端点，服务于其两个本地 DP rank；在 D2 上保留 API 不会改变其本地 DP 大小。D1 是 Data Parallel 主节点，两个 "
"Decode 脚本必须使用相同的 `DECODE_HEAD_IP`、DP RPC 端口和 KV 端口。"

msgid ""
"The following values match the configurations in the Prefill and Decode "
"scripts below and summarize the differences between the two roles. They use "
"128K input and 1K output; see the configuration table after the role summary"
" for the 16K input variant."
msgstr ""
"以下取值与下方 Prefill 和 Decode 脚本中的配置一致，并总结了两种角色的差异。它们使用 128K 输入和 1K 输出；16K "
"输入变体的配置请参见角色总结之后的配置表。"

msgid "| DP × TP × PP | 1 × 4 × 2 | 4 × 4 × 1 across two nodes |"
msgstr "| DP × TP × PP | 1 × 4 × 2 | 跨两个节点 4 × 4 × 1 |"

msgid ""
"| Main-model execution | Eager | FULL_DECODE_ONLY with 1024-token graph "
"capture |"
msgstr "| 主模型执行模式 | Eager | FULL_DECODE_ONLY，图捕获大小为 1024 token |"

msgid "| KV cache dtype | fp8 | fp8 (DSpark draft uses bfloat16) |"
msgstr "| KV cache 数据类型 | fp8 | fp8（DSpark draft 使用 bfloat16） |"

msgid ""
"All three scripts use `MAX_MODEL_LEN=133000`, which covers a 128K prompt "
"plus 1K generated tokens. For 16K input workloads, only the Decode side "
"changes: lower the sequence limit and fall back to the default graph capture"
" size, which is enough for 64 sequences × (1 + 7 draft tokens) = 512 tokens "
"per step."
msgstr ""
"三个脚本均使用 `MAX_MODEL_LEN=133000`，可覆盖 128K 提示词加上 1K 生成 token。对于 16K 输入负载，仅 "
"Decode 侧需要修改：降低序列上限并回退到默认图捕获大小，该大小足以支持每步 64 个序列 ×（1 + 7 个 draft token）= 512 "
"个 token。"

msgid "| Parameter | 128K input / 1K output | 16K input / 1K output |"
msgstr "| 参数 | 128K 输入 / 1K 输出 | 16K 输入 / 1K 输出 |"

msgid ""
"| Decode `--compilation-config` | "
"`{\"cudagraph_mode\":\"FULL_DECODE_ONLY\",\"max_cudagraph_capture_size\":1024}`"
" | `{\"cudagraph_mode\":\"FULL_DECODE_ONLY\"}` |"
msgstr ""
"| Decode `--compilation-config` | "
"`{\"cudagraph_mode\":\"FULL_DECODE_ONLY\",\"max_cudagraph_capture_size\":1024}`"
" | `{\"cudagraph_mode\":\"FULL_DECODE_ONLY\"}` |"

msgid ""
"| All other parameters | Unchanged | Unchanged; keep `MAX_MODEL_LEN=133000` "
"and `MAX_BATCHED_TOKENS=8000` |"
msgstr ""
"| 所有其他参数 | 不变 | 不变；保持 `MAX_MODEL_LEN=133000` 和 `MAX_BATCHED_TOKENS=8000` |"

msgid ""
"The capture size is not cosmetic: with 128 sequences and seven draft tokens,"
" one decode step holds 1024 tokens, and the default capture limit of 512 "
"makes the scheduler fall back to eager execution for the oversized batch, "
"which raises TPOT by an order of magnitude. With 64 sequences the default "
"limit is sufficient."
msgstr ""
"捕获大小并非无关紧要：在 128 个序列和七个 draft token 的情况下，一个 decode 步包含 1024 个 token，而默认捕获上限 "
"512 会使调度器对超大批次回退到 eager 执行，导致 TPOT 上升一个数量级。在 64 个序列时，默认上限已足够。"

msgid "**Deployment scripts**"
msgstr "**部署脚本**"

msgid ""
"Save the following as `run_decode_d1.sh` on D1. Set `LOCAL_IP` and "
"`NIC_NAME` for this host. The script also uses this IP as the Data Parallel "
"master address of the global DP8 group, so D2 must point at the same IP. "
"Keep the image, weights, global parallelism, and RPC port identical on both "
"Decode nodes."
msgstr ""
"将以下内容保存为 D1 上的 `run_decode_d1.sh`。为本机设置 `LOCAL_IP` 和 `NIC_NAME`。该脚本还使用此 IP "
"作为全局 DP8 组的 Data Parallel 主节点地址，因此 D2 必须指向相同的 IP。两台 Decode 节点上的镜像、权重、全局并行度和 "
"RPC 端口必须保持一致。"

msgid "Start all four D1 replicas; each replica serves one global DP rank:"
msgstr "启动全部四个 D1 副本；每个副本服务一个全局 DP rank："

msgid ""
"Save the following as `run_decode_d2.sh` on D2. Set `LOCAL_IP` and "
"`NIC_NAME` for this host, and set `DECODE_HEAD_IP` to the D1 IP used above. "
"The argument is the local rank on this node; global DP ranks are offset by "
"four."
msgstr ""
"将以下内容保存为 D2 上的 `run_decode_d2.sh`。为本机设置 `LOCAL_IP` 和 `NIC_NAME`，并将 "
"`DECODE_HEAD_IP` 设置为上面使用的 D1 IP。该参数是本节点上的本地 rank；全局 DP rank 偏移量为四。"

msgid "Start all four D2 replicas:"
msgstr "启动全部四个 D2 副本："

msgid ""
"Download [load_balance_proxy_server_example.py](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-"
"ascend/blob/main/examples/disaggregated_prefill_v1/load_balance_proxy_server_example.py)"
" from the official repository and save it as "
"`/workspace/load_balance_proxy_server_example.py` on a node that can reach "
"all Prefill and Decode API ports."
msgstr ""
"从官方仓库下载 [load_balance_proxy_server_example.py](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-"
"ascend/blob/main/examples/disaggregated_prefill_v1/load_balance_proxy_server_example.py)，并将其保存为可访问所有"
" Prefill 和 Decode API 端口的节点上的 "
"`/workspace/load_balance_proxy_server_example.py`。"

msgid ""
"Save the following as `proxy_server.sh` and start it after Prefill and all "
"eight Decode replicas print `Application startup complete`:"
msgstr ""
"将以下内容保存为 `proxy_server.sh`，并在 Prefill 和全部八个 Decode 副本打印 `Application startup"
" complete` 后启动它："

msgid "Send requests to port `19080` with model name `minimax-m3.1-flash`."
msgstr "将请求发送到端口 `19080`，模型名称为 `minimax-m3.1-flash`。"

msgid ""
"Save the following as `run_decode_head.sh` on D1. Set `LOCAL_IP` and "
"`NIC_NAME` for this host. D1 is the Data Parallel master, so the script uses"
" its own IP as `DECODE_HEAD_IP`; D2 must be configured with the same value."
msgstr ""
"将以下内容保存为 D1 上的 `run_decode_head.sh`。为本机设置 `LOCAL_IP` 和 `NIC_NAME`。D1 是 Data "
"Parallel 主节点，因此脚本使用其自身 IP 作为 `DECODE_HEAD_IP`；D2 必须配置相同的值。"

msgid "Start the Decode head:"
msgstr "启动 Decode 主节点："

msgid "**Decode Worker Node (D2, DP ranks 2–3)**"
msgstr "**Decode 工作节点（D2，DP rank 2–3）**"

msgid ""
"Save the following as `run_decode_worker.sh` on D2. Set `LOCAL_IP` and "
"`NIC_NAME` for this host, and set `DECODE_HEAD_IP` to the same D1 IP used "
"above. Keep the image, weights, parallelism, and RPC/KV ports identical to "
"D1. This node also serves the HTTP API and is registered as the second "
"Decode endpoint of the proxy; do not add `--headless`."
msgstr ""
"将以下内容保存为 D2 上的 `run_decode_worker.sh`。为本机设置 `LOCAL_IP` 和 `NIC_NAME`，并将 "
"`DECODE_HEAD_IP` 设置为上面使用的相同 D1 IP。镜像、权重、并行度和 RPC/KV 端口必须与 D1 保持一致。该节点还提供 "
"HTTP API，并注册为代理的第二个 Decode 端点；不要添加 `--headless`。"

msgid "Start the Decode worker at the same time as D1:"
msgstr "与 D1 同时启动 Decode 工作节点："

msgid ""
"Both Decode nodes must join before the distributed Decode group can become "
"ready."
msgstr "两台 Decode 节点必须都加入后，分布式 Decode 组才能就绪。"

msgid ""
"Download [load_balance_proxy_server_example.py](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-"
"ascend/blob/main/examples/disaggregated_prefill_v1/load_balance_proxy_server_example.py)"
" from the official repository and save it as "
"`/workspace/load_balance_proxy_server_example.py` on a node that can reach "
"the Prefill and both Decode API ports."
msgstr ""
"从官方仓库下载 [load_balance_proxy_server_example.py](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-"
"ascend/blob/main/examples/disaggregated_prefill_v1/load_balance_proxy_server_example.py)，并将其保存为可访问"
" Prefill 和两个 Decode API 端口的节点上的 "
"`/workspace/load_balance_proxy_server_example.py`。"

msgid ""
"After Prefill, D1, and D2 print `Application startup complete`, save the "
"following as `proxy_server.sh` and start it:"
msgstr ""
"在 Prefill、D1 和 D2 打印 `Application startup complete` 后，将以下内容保存为 "
"`proxy_server.sh` 并启动它："

msgid ""
"Each Decode node registers one endpoint that fronts its two local DP ranks, "
"so the proxy lists two Decode hosts even though the DP group has four ranks."
" Send requests to port `19080` with model name `minimax-m3.1-flash`."
msgstr ""
"每台 Decode 节点注册一个端点，代理其两个本地 DP rank，因此尽管 DP 组有四个 rank，代理仍列出两台 Decode "
"主机。将请求发送到端口 `19080`，模型名称为 `minimax-m3.1-flash`。"

msgid "### 5.4 Prefill-Decode Disaggregation with KV Cache Pool"
msgstr "### 5.4 使用 KV Cache 池的 Prefill-Decode 分离部署"

msgid ""
"This section builds on [Section 5.3](#53-pd-disaggregation-1p1d) and keeps "
"its 1P1D topology, role scripts, proxy mapping, and MiniMax-M3.1-Flash `vllm"
" serve` settings on both platforms. On Atlas 800I A3, one Prefill service "
"runs with `DP1 × TP4 × PP4` and one distributed Decode service runs with a "
"global `DP8 × TP4 × PP1` group spanning two hosts, with four local ranks per"
" host. On 950DT products, one Prefill service runs with `DP1 × TP4 × PP2` "
"and one distributed Decode service runs with a global `DP4 × TP4 × PP1` "
"group spanning two hosts, with two local ranks per host. Prefill and Decode "
"switch to `MultiConnector` so live P→D KV transfer and Mooncake KV Cache "
"Pool work together:"
msgstr ""
"本节基于[第 5.3 节](#53-pd-disaggregation-1p1d)构建，并在两个平台上保留其 1P1D 拓扑、角色脚本、代理映射以及 "
"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash 的 `vllm serve` 设置。在 Atlas 800I A3 上，一个 Prefill 服务以 `DP1 ×"
" TP4 × PP4` 运行，一个分布式 Decode 服务以跨两台主机的全局 `DP8 × TP4 × PP1` 组运行，每台主机有四个本地 "
"rank。在 Ascend 950DT系列产品上，一个 Prefill 服务以 `DP1 × TP4 × PP2` 运行，一个分布式 Decode "
"服务以跨两台主机的全局 `DP4 × TP4 × PP1` 组运行，每台主机有两个本地 rank。Prefill 和 Decode 切换为 "
"`MultiConnector`，使实时 P→D KV 传输与 Mooncake KV Cache Pool 协同工作："

msgid ""
"- `MooncakeConnectorV1` transfers KV from Prefill to Decode in real time (same role as Section 5.3).\n"
"- `AscendStoreConnector` stores KV in the Mooncake KV Cache Pool so later Prefills with the same prefix can hit the pool instead of recomputing.\n"
"- By default the Prefill node performs pool lookup, load, and write."
msgstr ""
"- `MooncakeConnectorV1` 实时将 KV 从 Prefill 传输到 Decode（与第 5.3 节角色相同）。\n"
"- `AscendStoreConnector` 将 KV 存储到 Mooncake KV Cache Pool 中，以便后续具有相同前缀的 Prefill 可以命中池，而无需重新计算。\n"
"- 默认情况下，Prefill 节点执行池查找、加载和写入。"

msgid ""
"The examples below enable three-tier KV storage: the active NPU KV cache, "
"the Mooncake memory pool, and SSD offload."
msgstr "以下示例启用三层 KV 存储：活跃的 NPU KV 缓存、Mooncake 内存池以及 SSD 卸载。"

msgid ""
"For backend selection, `mooncake.json`, Mooncake Master, eviction, tenant "
"options, and hardware-specific pooling exports, refer to the [KV Cache Pool "
"Deployment "
"Guide](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md). For "
"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash-specific issues, refer to [Chapter 10 FAQ](#10-faq)."
msgstr ""
"有关后端选择、`mooncake.json`、Mooncake Master、驱逐、租户选项以及硬件特定的池化导出，请参阅 [KV Cache Pool"
" 部署指南](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md)。有关 "
"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash 特有的问题，请参阅[第 10 章 FAQ](#10-faq)。"

msgid ""
"**Compared with normal PD in Section 5.3, pay attention to these pooling-"
"only requirements:**"
msgstr "**与第 5.3 节中的普通 PD 相比，请注意以下仅池化场景才有的要求：**"

msgid "| Item | Normal PD (5.3) | Pooled PD (this section) |"
msgstr "| 项目 | 普通 PD（5.3） | 池化 PD（本节） |"

msgid ""
"| Connector | Single `MooncakeConnectorV1` | `MultiConnector` wrapping "
"`MooncakeConnectorV1` + `AscendStoreConnector` |"
msgstr ""
"| Connector | 单个 `MooncakeConnectorV1` | `MultiConnector` 封装 "
"`MooncakeConnectorV1` + `AscendStoreConnector` |"

msgid ""
"| Mooncake Master | Not required | Start `mooncake_master "
"--enable_offload=true` before Decode / Prefill |"
msgstr ""
"| Mooncake Master | 不需要 | 在 Decode / Prefill 之前启动 `mooncake_master "
"--enable_offload=true` |"

msgid ""
"| `mooncake.json` | Not required | Required on every rank; A3 P and both D "
"nodes use `4GB`, 950DT P and both D nodes use `64GB`; enable SSD offload on "
"all nodes |"
msgstr ""
"| `mooncake.json` | 不需要 | 每个 rank 都需要；A3 的 P 和两个 D 节点使用 `4GB`，950DT 的 P 和两个 "
"D 节点使用 `64GB`；在所有节点上启用 SSD 卸载 |"

msgid ""
"| `lookup_rpc_port` | Not used | **Must be unique per DP rank** "
"(`37000/37100 + DP_RANK`); on 950DT products use one distinct base port per "
"host (D1 `37100`, D2 `37102`) to avoid IPC endpoint collisions |"
msgstr ""
"| `lookup_rpc_port` | 不使用 | **每个 DP rank 必须唯一**（`37000/37100 + DP_RANK`）；在 "
"Ascend 950DT系列产品上，每台主机使用一个不同的基础端口（D1 `37100`，D2 `37102`）以避免 IPC 端点冲突 |"

msgid ""
"| Extra env | Section 5.3 `HCCL_*` only | Keep 5.3 env, then add A3 fabric-"
"memory or 950DT Device UB exports from [KV Cache Pool Deployment "
"Guide](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md) |"
msgstr ""
"| 额外环境变量 | 仅第 5.3 节的 `HCCL_*` | 保留 5.3 的环境变量，然后从 [KV Cache Pool "
"部署指南](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md) 添加 A3 "
"fabric-memory 或 950DT Device UB 导出 |"

msgid ""
"| Container mounts | `/etc/hccn.conf`; 950DT products also keep "
"`/etc/hixlep/` | Also mount the local SSD offload directory |"
msgstr ""
"| 容器挂载 | `/etc/hccn.conf`；Ascend 950DT系列产品还保留 `/etc/hixlep/` | 还需挂载本地 SSD "
"卸载目录 |"

msgid ""
"| Startup order | Decode → Prefill → Proxy | **Mooncake Master → Decode → "
"Prefill → Proxy** |"
msgstr ""
"| 启动顺序 | Decode → Prefill → Proxy | **Mooncake Master → Decode → Prefill → "
"Proxy** |"

msgid ""
"| Verification | P→D KV transfer only | Also check Prefill pool "
"lookup/get/put hits after a repeated-prefix warmup |"
msgstr "| 验证 | 仅 P→D KV 传输 | 在重复前缀预热后，还需检查 Prefill 池查找/获取/写入的命中情况 |"

msgid "#### 5.4.1 Prerequisites"
msgstr "#### 5.4.1 前提条件"

msgid ""
"Mount the host HCCN config into every A3 container that participates in "
"pooling:"
msgstr "将主机的 HCCN 配置挂载到每个参与池化的 A3 容器中："

msgid ""
"On 950DT products, keep the `/etc/hixlep/` mount from Section 5.3 as well. "
"The pooled 950DT scripts export `ASCEND_LOCAL_COMM_RES_PATH=/etc/hixlep/`, "
"and the KV pool path uses that directory for Device UB communication. The "
"validated 950DT deployment used only that mount; `/etc/hccn.conf` was not "
"present in its containers and was not required."
msgstr ""
"在 Ascend 950DT系列产品上，还需保留第 5.3 节中的 `/etc/hixlep/` 挂载。池化的 950DT 脚本导出 "
"`ASCEND_LOCAL_COMM_RES_PATH=/etc/hixlep/`，KV 池路径使用该目录进行 Device UB 通信。经验证的 "
"950DT 部署仅使用该挂载；其容器中不存在 `/etc/hccn.conf`，也不需要它。"

msgid ""
"Use a local SSD directory on each Prefill and Decode host to store KV cache "
"data offloaded from the memory pool. `/nvme/mooncake_offload` is an example "
"directory inside the container, not a required SSD mount point or a "
"directory that already exists on every host."
msgstr ""
"在每个 Prefill 和 Decode 主机上使用本地 SSD 目录来存储从内存池卸载的 KV "
"缓存数据。`/nvme/mooncake_offload` 是容器内的示例目录，不是必需的 SSD 挂载点，也不是每台主机上都已存在的目录。"

msgid "On each host, first identify the local SSD and its mount point:"
msgstr "在每台主机上，首先识别本地 SSD 及其挂载点："

msgid ""
"Use `MODEL` to identify the SSD and `MOUNTPOINTS` to find its mounted "
"filesystem. `ROTA=0` indicates a non-rotational device; confirm the storage "
"type with the machine's disk information, especially for RAID or virtual "
"disks. Choose an existing local SSD filesystem with enough free space. A "
"shared network filesystem is not the local SSD tier."
msgstr ""
"使用 `MODEL` 识别 SSD，使用 `MOUNTPOINTS` 查找其挂载的文件系统。`ROTA=0` "
"表示非旋转设备；请通过机器的磁盘信息确认存储类型，尤其是 RAID 或虚拟磁盘。选择一个具有足够可用空间的现有本地 SSD "
"文件系统。共享网络文件系统不属于本地 SSD 层。"

msgid ""
"For example, if the SSD is mounted at `/data/nvme`, create the offload "
"directory there before starting the container. Replace `/data/nvme` below "
"with the actual SSD mount point:"
msgstr ""
"例如，如果 SSD 挂载在 `/data/nvme`，请在启动容器之前在该处创建卸载目录。将下面的 `/data/nvme` 替换为实际的 SSD "
"挂载点："

msgid ""
"Confirm that `findmnt` reports the selected SSD filesystem and that `df` "
"shows enough available space. Creating a directory named `/nvme` alone does "
"not mount an SSD or ensure that data is stored on one."
msgstr ""
"确认 `findmnt` 报告了所选的 SSD 文件系统，并且 `df` 显示足够的可用空间。仅创建一个名为 `/nvme` 的目录并不会挂载 "
"SSD，也不能确保数据存储在其上。"

msgid "Add this bind mount when creating each model container:"
msgstr "在创建每个模型容器时添加此绑定挂载："

msgid ""
"The left side is the directory on that host's SSD; the right side is the "
"directory visible inside the container. With this mapping, keep "
"`\"ssd_offload_path\": \"/nvme/mooncake_offload\"` in `mooncake.json`. If "
"the container path changes, update `ssd_offload_path` to match. Use an "
"absolute path that exists and is writable by the vLLM process; do not use a "
"symlink. Repeat this setup on P and every D host: identical path strings "
"refer to separate local SSD storage on each host. The backend creates per-"
"rank subdirectories beneath it. The installed Mooncake package must support "
"the `enable_ssd_offload` and `ssd_offload_path` arguments in "
"`MooncakeDistributedStore.setup()`; use the dependencies in the [KV Cache "
"Pool Deployment "
"Guide](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md)."
msgstr ""
"左侧是该主机 SSD 上的目录；右侧是容器内可见的目录。使用此映射时，在 `mooncake.json` 中保留 "
"`\"ssd_offload_path\": \"/nvme/mooncake_offload\"`。如果容器路径发生变化，请更新 "
"`ssd_offload_path` 以匹配。使用一个存在且 vLLM 进程可写的绝对路径；不要使用符号链接。在 P 和每个 D "
"主机上重复此设置：相同的路径字符串在每台主机上指向各自独立的本地 SSD 存储。后端会在其下创建每个 rank 的子目录。已安装的 Mooncake "
"包必须支持 `MooncakeDistributedStore.setup()` 中的 `enable_ssd_offload` 和 "
"`ssd_offload_path` 参数；请使用 [KV Cache Pool "
"部署指南](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md) 中的依赖项。"

msgid ""
"Place `mooncake.json` next to the role scripts on every node "
"(`run_prefill.sh` and the two Decode scripts). Use the same reachable "
"Mooncake Master address and `tenant_id` across P and D. "
"`global_segment_size` is allocated per worker rank, not per node; a non-zero"
" value must be aligned to `1GB`. If `MOONCAKE_GLOBAL_SEGMENT_SIZE` is "
"already exported, update it to the intended size or unset it before startup "
"because it overrides the JSON value."
msgstr ""
"在每个节点上将 `mooncake.json` 放在角色脚本（`run_prefill.sh` 和两个 Decode 脚本）旁边。在 P 和 D "
"之间使用相同的可访问 Mooncake Master 地址和 `tenant_id`。`global_segment_size` 按 worker "
"rank 分配，而不是按节点分配；非零值必须对齐到 `1GB`。如果已导出 "
"`MOONCAKE_GLOBAL_SEGMENT_SIZE`，请将其更新为预期大小，或在启动前取消设置，因为它会覆盖 JSON 中的值。"

msgid "**A3: Prefill and Decode configuration**"
msgstr "**A3：Prefill 与 Decode 配置**"

msgid ""
"Use the following `mooncake.json` on P, D1, and D2. Replace "
"`<MOONCAKE_MASTER_IP>` with the actual Master IP."
msgstr ""
"在 P、D1 和 D2 上使用以下 `mooncake.json`。将 `<MOONCAKE_MASTER_IP>` 替换为实际的 Master IP。"

msgid ""
"The A3 example uses `4GB` per worker rank on P and both D nodes. Adjust this"
" value to each machine's available allocatable memory and fragmentation "
"after reserving memory for vLLM and other processes. Allow additional space "
"for the SSD I/O buffer and allocation headroom, and account for all "
"contributing worker ranks on the node."
msgstr ""
"A3 示例在 P 和两个 D 节点上为每个 worker rank 使用 `4GB`。请根据每台机器在为 vLLM "
"及其他进程预留内存后的可分配内存和内存碎片情况调整该值。需为 SSD I/O 缓冲区和分配余量预留额外空间，并考虑节点上所有参与的 worker "
"rank。"

msgid "**950DT: Prefill configuration**"
msgstr "**950DT：Prefill 配置**"

msgid ""
"Use the following `mooncake.json` on Prefill, with `preferred_segment` set "
"to `false`. Replace `<MOONCAKE_MASTER_IP>` with the actual Master IP."
msgstr ""
"在 Prefill 上使用以下 `mooncake.json`，并将 `preferred_segment` 设置为 `false`。将 "
"`<MOONCAKE_MASTER_IP>` 替换为实际的 Master IP。"

msgid "**950DT: Decode configuration**"
msgstr "**950DT：Decode 配置**"

msgid ""
"Use the following `mooncake.json` on both D1 and D2, with "
"`preferred_segment` set to `true`. Keep the Master address and `tenant_id` "
"identical to Prefill."
msgstr ""
"在 D1 和 D2 上使用以下 `mooncake.json`，并将 `preferred_segment` 设置为 `true`。保持 Master "
"地址和 `tenant_id` 与 Prefill 一致。"

msgid ""
"The 950DT examples use `64GB` per worker rank on Prefill and both Decode "
"hosts. The validated deployment used `/data/mooncake_offload` because those "
"hosts have no `/nvme` mount; `/data` is a local ext4 filesystem on each host"
" and is visible inside the container with the same path. If your hosts use a"
" different local SSD directory, bind-mount it into the container and set "
"`ssd_offload_path` to the container path. As with the A3 example, adjust the"
" segment size to each machine's allocatable memory and fragmentation instead"
" of treating `64GB` as a fixed requirement."
msgstr ""
"950DT 示例在 Prefill 和两个 Decode 主机上为每个 worker rank 使用 `64GB`。经验证的部署使用 "
"`/data/mooncake_offload`，因为这些主机没有 `/nvme` 挂载点；`/data` 是每台主机上的本地 ext4 "
"文件系统，并在容器内以相同路径可见。如果主机使用不同的本地 SSD 目录，请将其 bind-mount 到容器中，并将 "
"`ssd_offload_path` 设置为容器内路径。与 A3 示例一样，请根据每台机器的可分配内存和内存碎片情况调整 segment 大小，而不要将"
" `64GB` 视为固定要求。"

msgid "#### 5.4.2 Environment Variables"
msgstr "#### 5.4.2 环境变量"

msgid ""
"Start from the Section 5.3 environment block for your platform "
"(`HCCL_IF_IP`, `HCCL`/`GLOO` socket IFNAME, `HCCL_BUFFSIZE`, "
"`PYTORCH_NPU_ALLOC_CONF`, `ASCEND_RT_VISIBLE_DEVICES`, and, on A3 Prefill, "
"`VLLM_PP_LAYER_PARTITION=\"15,15,15,15\"`). Then add the pooling-required "
"variables below. Choose the hardware/communication exports from the "
"[Mooncake backend startup "
"examples](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md#step-4-start-"
"vllm-inference-service) according to your machine and link type."
msgstr ""
"从适用于您平台的第 5.3 节环境变量块开始（`HCCL_IF_IP`、`HCCL`/`GLOO` socket "
"IFNAME、`HCCL_BUFFSIZE`、`PYTORCH_NPU_ALLOC_CONF`、`ASCEND_RT_VISIBLE_DEVICES`，以及在"
" A3 Prefill 上的 `VLLM_PP_LAYER_PARTITION=\"15,15,15,15\"`）。然后添加下方 pooling "
"所需的环境变量。请根据您的机器和链路类型，从 [Mooncake "
"后端启动示例](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md#step-4-start-"
"vllm-inference-service) 中选择硬件/通信相关的导出项。"

msgid "Common pooling exports on Prefill node and DP ranks:"
msgstr "Prefill 节点和 DP rank 上的通用 pooling 导出项："

msgid ""
"On Atlas 800I A3 with the HCCS fabric link, also export "
"`ASCEND_ENABLE_USE_FABRIC_MEM=1`."
msgstr ""
"在使用 HCCS fabric 链路的 Atlas 800I A3 上，还需导出 `ASCEND_ENABLE_USE_FABRIC_MEM=1`。"

msgid ""
"On 950DT products, export the Device UB settings and clear the global "
"resource override instead:"
msgstr "在 950DT 产品上，改为导出 Device UB 设置并清除全局资源覆盖："

msgid ""
"The SSD I/O buffer is allocated separately from `global_segment_size`. The "
"`1GB` value above is an aligned starting point; size it for the KV "
"read/write batches and include it in the per-rank memory budget."
msgstr ""
"SSD I/O 缓冲区与 `global_segment_size` 分开分配。上述 `1GB` 值是一个对齐的起始值；请根据 KV "
"读写批次确定其大小，并将其计入每个 rank 的内存预算。"

msgid ""
"For this three-tier (NPU, host memory, and SSD) example, the recommended "
"starting SSD budget is **10 GiB per NPU worker rank** on every Prefill and "
"Decode node. The two capacity limits describe the same SSD budget; they do "
"not add up to 20 GiB:"
msgstr ""
"对于此三层（NPU、主机内存和 SSD）示例，建议在每个 Prefill 和 Decode 节点上为**每个 NPU worker rank 分配 10"
" GiB** 的 SSD 预算作为起始值。这两个容量限制描述的是同一个 SSD 预算；它们不会累加为 20 GiB："

msgid ""
"- `MOONCAKE_OFFLOAD_TOTAL_SIZE_LIMIT_BYTES` sets the per-worker SSD capacity reported to Mooncake Master. Its default is `2199023255552` bytes (2 TiB) per worker; this is advertised capacity, not an immediate disk allocation.\n"
"- `MOONCAKE_OFFLOAD_BUCKET_MAX_TOTAL_SIZE` sets the local bucket size limit. Its default is `0`, meaning 90% of the physical disk capacity. Set it explicitly alongside the reported capacity.\n"
"- `MOONCAKE_OFFLOAD_BUCKET_EVICTION_POLICY=lru` enables least-recently-used eviction, removing old SSD cache entries to make room for new writes within the configured bucket limit."
msgstr ""
"- `MOONCAKE_OFFLOAD_TOTAL_SIZE_LIMIT_BYTES` 设置向 Mooncake Master 报告的每个 worker 的 SSD 容量。其默认值为每个 worker `2199023255552` 字节（2 TiB）；这是对外通告的容量，而非立即分配的磁盘空间。\n"
"- `MOONCAKE_OFFLOAD_BUCKET_MAX_TOTAL_SIZE` 设置本地 bucket 大小限制。其默认值为 `0`，表示物理磁盘容量的 90%。请将其与报告的容量一起显式设置。\n"
"- `MOONCAKE_OFFLOAD_BUCKET_EVICTION_POLICY=lru` 启用最近最少使用（LRU）淘汰策略，在配置的 bucket 限制内移除旧的 SSD 缓存条目，为新写入腾出空间。"

msgid ""
"Adjust both values to the workload and usable SSD space, allowing for all "
"workers sharing that disk and leaving room for other data. Count TP and PP "
"worker ranks, not just DP ranks or physical cards: an A3 node with 16 "
"logical NPU workers has a combined budget of 160 GiB at 10 GiB per worker. "
"These limits control SSD usage; they do not change the host-memory pool or "
"SSD I/O buffer size. For details, see [Mooncake SSD Offload Parameter "
"Tuning](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md#mooncake-"
"ssd-offload-parameter-tuning)."
msgstr ""
"请根据工作负载和可用 SSD 空间调整这两个值，需考虑共享该磁盘的所有 worker，并为其他数据留出空间。请统计 TP 和 PP worker "
"rank，而不仅仅是 DP rank 或物理卡：一个拥有 16 个逻辑 NPU worker 的 A3 节点在每 worker 10 GiB 时总预算为"
" 160 GiB。这些限制控制 SSD 使用量；它们不会改变主机内存池或 SSD I/O 缓冲区大小。详情请参阅 [Mooncake SSD "
"Offload "
"参数调优](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md#mooncake-"
"ssd-offload-parameter-tuning)。"

msgid "| Hardware | Dependencies | Required pooling exports | Notes |"
msgstr "| 硬件 | 依赖 | 必需的 pooling 导出项 | 备注 |"

msgid ""
"| 800I/T A3 (HCCS, recommended) | HDK >= 26.0, or HDK >= 25.5 with mooncake "
">= v0.3.11; CANN >= 9.0.0 | `export ASCEND_ENABLE_USE_FABRIC_MEM=1` | Keep "
"the Section 5.3 `HCCL_IF_IP` / socket IFNAME exports. |"
msgstr ""
"| 800I/T A3（HCCS，推荐） | HDK >= 26.0，或 HDK >= 25.5 且 mooncake >= v0.3.11；CANN "
">= 9.0.0 | `export ASCEND_ENABLE_USE_FABRIC_MEM=1` | 保留第 5.3 节的 `HCCL_IF_IP`"
" / socket IFNAME 导出项。 |"

msgid ""
"| 950PR/DT (Device UB) | HDK >= 25.6 with mooncake >= v0.3.11; CANN >= 9.1.0"
" | `export ASCEND_LOCAL_COMM_RES_PATH=/etc/hixlep/` and `export "
"ASCEND_LOCAL_COMM_RES='{\"version\":\"1.3\"}'`; `unset "
"ASCEND_GLOBAL_RESOURCE_CONFIG` | Mount `/etc/hixlep/`. For UBOE instead, use"
" `ASCEND_GLOBAL_RESOURCE_CONFIG` as described in the KV Cache Pool guide. |"
msgstr ""
"| 950PR/DT（Device UB） | HDK >= 25.6 且 mooncake >= v0.3.11；CANN >= 9.1.0 | "
"`export ASCEND_LOCAL_COMM_RES_PATH=/etc/hixlep/` 和 `export "
"ASCEND_LOCAL_COMM_RES='{\"version\":\"1.3\"}'`；`unset "
"ASCEND_GLOBAL_RESOURCE_CONFIG` | 挂载 `/etc/hixlep/`。若改用 UBOE，请按 KV Cache Pool"
" 指南中所述使用 `ASCEND_GLOBAL_RESOURCE_CONFIG`。 |"

msgid "#### 5.4.3 Prefill / Decode Scripts"
msgstr "#### 5.4.3 Prefill / Decode 脚本"

msgid "**Key parameters**"
msgstr "**关键参数**"

msgid ""
"`MultiConnector` creates a separate `KVTransferConfig` for each entry in "
"`connectors`; child connectors do not inherit the outer `kv_role`. Both "
"child connectors must specify `kv_connector` and `kv_role`. The scripts "
"below set `KV_ROLE=kv_producer` on Prefill and `KV_ROLE=kv_consumer` on "
"Decode, and explicitly pass that role to both children."
msgstr ""
"`MultiConnector` 会为 `connectors` 中的每个条目创建单独的 `KVTransferConfig`；子连接器不会继承外层的 "
"`kv_role`。两个子连接器都必须指定 `kv_connector` 和 `kv_role`。下方脚本在 Prefill 上设置 "
"`KV_ROLE=kv_producer`，在 Decode 上设置 `KV_ROLE=kv_consumer`，并将该角色显式传递给两个子连接器。"

msgid "| Child connector | Port configuration in this example |"
msgstr "| 子连接器 | 本示例中的端口配置 |"

msgid ""
"| `MooncakeConnectorV1` | Set `kv_port` explicitly for the P→D connection, "
"using the role-specific `KV_PORT` from Section 5.3. |"
msgstr ""
"| `MooncakeConnectorV1` | 为 P→D 连接显式设置 `kv_port`，使用第 5.3 节中与角色相关的 `KV_PORT`。"
" |"

msgid ""
"| `AscendStoreConnector` | No explicit `kv_port` is needed: this connector "
"does not use it. Set `kv_connector_extra_config.lookup_rpc_port` for its "
"lookup IPC endpoint and `backend` to `mooncake`; configure the Mooncake "
"Master address separately in `mooncake.json`. |"
msgstr ""
"| `AscendStoreConnector` | 无需显式设置 `kv_port`：此连接器不使用它。为其 lookup IPC 端点设置 "
"`kv_connector_extra_config.lookup_rpc_port`，并将 `backend` 设置为 `mooncake`；在 "
"`mooncake.json` 中单独配置 Mooncake Master 地址。 |"

msgid ""
"The shared `KVTransferConfig` schema provides a default `kv_port`, so "
"omitting it is not equivalent to omitting `kv_role`. In particular, "
"`AscendStoreConnector` still requires its own `kv_role`; do not remove that "
"field from either child."
msgstr ""
"共享的 `KVTransferConfig` schema 提供了默认的 `kv_port`，因此省略它并不等同于省略 `kv_role`。特别是 "
"`AscendStoreConnector` 仍需要自己的 `kv_role`；请勿从任一子连接器中移除该字段。"

msgid ""
"Reuse the Section 5.3 role scripts and launch commands. Replace each role "
"script with the pooled version below. Keep the Section 5.3 `vllm serve` flag"
" style; only `--kv-transfer-config` switches to `MultiConnector`. Derive the"
" Decode `lookup_rpc_port` from `DP_RANK` so each rank uses a distinct IPC "
"endpoint; Prefill has one DP rank and uses `37000`. On 950DT products, one "
"`vllm serve` process per host serves two local DP ranks and the lookup "
"endpoint is namespaced per local DP rank from the base port, so each host "
"uses one distinct base port (D1 `37100`, D2 `37102`)."
msgstr ""
"复用第 5.3 节的角色脚本和启动命令。将每个角色脚本替换为下方的池化版本。保持第 5.3 节的 `vllm serve` 参数风格；仅将 `--kv-"
"transfer-config` 切换为 `MultiConnector`。根据 `DP_RANK` 推导 Decode 的 "
"`lookup_rpc_port`，使每个 rank 使用不同的 IPC 端点；Prefill 只有一个 DP rank，使用 `37000`。在 "
"Ascend 950DT系列产品上，每台主机上的一个 `vllm serve` 进程服务两个本地 DP rank，lookup 端点基于基础端口按本地 "
"DP rank 划分命名空间，因此每台主机使用一个不同的基础端口（D1 `37100`，D2 `37102`）。"

msgid ""
"Prefill-Decode disaggregation with KV Cache Pool on 3 Atlas 800I A3 (64GB × "
"16) for `MiniMax-M3.1-Flash-W8A8` with DSpark speculative decoding."
msgstr ""
"在 3 台 Atlas 800I A3（64GB × 16）上，为 `MiniMax-M3.1-Flash-W8A8` 使用 DSpark "
"投机解码，实现带 KV Cache Pool 的 Prefill-Decode 分离部署。"

msgid ""
"The 1P1D topology uses one Prefill service with `DP1 × TP4 × PP4` on one "
"host and one distributed Decode service with a global `DP8 × TP4 × PP1` "
"group spanning two hosts, with four local ranks per Decode host. Service "
"settings match Section 5.3; `MultiConnector` adds the KV pool."
msgstr ""
"1P1D 拓扑在一台主机上使用一个 `DP1 × TP4 × PP4` 的 Prefill 服务，以及一个跨两台主机的全局 `DP8 × TP4 × "
"PP1` 分布式 Decode 服务，每台 Decode 主机有四个本地 rank。服务设置与第 5.3 节一致；`MultiConnector` "
"增加了 KV 池。"

msgid ""
"Prefill-Decode disaggregation with KV Cache Pool on 950DT products (96GB × "
"8) for `MiniMax-M3.1-Flash-W8A8-MXFP8` with DSpark speculative decoding."
msgstr ""
"在 Ascend 950DT系列产品（96GB × 8）上，为 `MiniMax-M3.1-Flash-W8A8-MXFP8` 使用 DSpark "
"投机解码，实现带 KV Cache Pool 的 Prefill-Decode 分离部署。"

msgid ""
"The 1P1D topology uses one Prefill service with `DP1 × TP4 × PP2` on one "
"host and one distributed Decode service with a global `DP4 × TP4 × PP1` "
"group spanning two hosts, with two local ranks per Decode host. Both Decode "
"hosts serve the HTTP API on port `31060` and join one data-parallel group; "
"do not add `--headless`. Service settings match Section 5.3; "
"`MultiConnector` adds the KV pool."
msgstr ""
"1P1D 拓扑在一台主机上使用一个 `DP1 × TP4 × PP2` 的 Prefill 服务，以及一个跨两台主机的全局 `DP4 × TP4 × "
"PP1` 分布式 Decode 服务，每台 Decode 主机有两个本地 rank。两台 Decode 主机均在端口 `31060` 上提供 HTTP "
"API 并加入同一个数据并行组；不要添加 `--headless`。服务设置与第 5.3 节一致；`MultiConnector` 增加了 KV 池。"

msgid "**1. Prefill node**"
msgstr "**1. Prefill 节点**"

msgid "Save as `run_prefill.sh` alongside `mooncake.json`."
msgstr "保存为 `run_prefill.sh`，与 `mooncake.json` 放在同一目录。"

msgid "**2. First Decode node**"
msgstr "**2. 第一个 Decode 节点**"

msgid "Save as `run_decode_d1.sh` alongside `mooncake.json`."
msgstr "保存为 `run_decode_d1.sh`，与 `mooncake.json` 放在同一目录。"

msgid "**3. Second Decode node**"
msgstr "**3. 第二个 Decode 节点**"

msgid "Save as `run_decode_d2.sh` alongside `mooncake.json`."
msgstr "保存为 `run_decode_d2.sh`，与 `mooncake.json` 放在同一目录。"

msgid "**2. First Decode node (D1)**"
msgstr "**2. 第一个 Decode 节点（D1）**"

msgid ""
"Save as `run_decode_d1.sh` alongside `mooncake.json`. This is the pooled "
"replacement of the Section 5.3 950DT `run_decode_head.sh`. D1 is the Data "
"Parallel master, serves local DP ranks 0–1, and exposes API port `31060`. D2"
" must use the same `DECODE_HEAD_IP` and `DP_RPC_PORT`."
msgstr ""
"保存为 `run_decode_d1.sh`，与 `mooncake.json` 放在同一目录。这是第 5.3 节 950DT "
"`run_decode_head.sh` 的池化替代版本。D1 是数据并行主节点，服务本地 DP rank 0–1，并暴露 API 端口 "
"`31060`。D2 必须使用相同的 `DECODE_HEAD_IP` 和 `DP_RPC_PORT`。"

msgid "**3. Second Decode node (D2)**"
msgstr "**3. 第二个 Decode 节点（D2）**"

msgid ""
"Save as `run_decode_d2.sh` alongside `mooncake.json`. This is the pooled "
"replacement of the Section 5.3 950DT `run_decode_worker.sh`. Set `LOCAL_IP` "
"and `NIC_NAME` for this host, keep `DECODE_HEAD_IP` equal to D1's IP, and "
"keep every other value identical to D1 except `--data-parallel-start-rank` "
"(`2` here) and `LOOKUP_RPC_PORT` (`37102` here)."
msgstr ""
"保存为 `run_decode_d2.sh`，与 `mooncake.json` 放在同一目录。这是第 5.3 节 950DT "
"`run_decode_worker.sh` 的池化替代版本。为本机设置 `LOCAL_IP` 和 `NIC_NAME`，保持 "
"`DECODE_HEAD_IP` 等于 D1 的 IP，并且除 `--data-parallel-start-rank`（此处为 `2`）和 "
"`LOOKUP_RPC_PORT`（此处为 `37102`）外，其余所有值均与 D1 保持一致。"

msgid "#### 5.4.4 Start the Services"
msgstr "#### 5.4.4 启动服务"

msgid "Start in this order:"
msgstr "按以下顺序启动："

msgid ""
"1. Start `mooncake_master` on the Prefill node or another reachable host, "
"and use its actual IP in every `mooncake.json`. Confirm port `50088` is "
"reachable from all model nodes:"
msgstr ""
"1. 在 Prefill 节点或其他可达主机上启动 `mooncake_master`，并在每个 `mooncake.json` 中使用其实际 "
"IP。确认所有模型节点均可访问端口 `50088`："

msgid ""
"These are example Master settings: `default_kv_lease_ttl=11000` is in "
"milliseconds, while `client_ttl=120` is in seconds. The eviction ratios are "
"dimensionless; see the [Mooncake Master parameter "
"table](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md#step-2-configure-"
"mooncakejson-and-start-mooncake_master) for their meanings and supported "
"ranges. Keep `enable_offload=true` for this SSD-offload deployment."
msgstr ""
"以下是 Master 的示例设置：`default_kv_lease_ttl=11000` 的单位为毫秒，而 `client_ttl=120` "
"的单位为秒。驱逐比例为无量纲值；其含义和支持范围请参见 [Mooncake Master "
"参数表](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md#step-2-configure-"
"mooncakejson-and-start-mooncake_master)。对于此 SSD 卸载部署，请保持 "
"`enable_offload=true`。"

msgid ""
"Before starting the model services, run this TCP connectivity check from "
"each model container, replacing the Master IP. Continue only after it "
"succeeds and the Master logs show successful startup. If it fails, check the"
" Master process, bind address, and network access, then retry:"
msgstr ""
"在启动模型服务之前，从每个模型容器运行此 TCP 连通性检查，并替换 Master IP。仅在其成功且 Master "
"日志显示启动成功后继续。如果失败，请检查 Master 进程、绑定地址和网络访问，然后重试："

msgid ""
"This checks the TCP listener; successful worker registration and KV "
"operations are verified in Section 5.4.5."
msgstr "此检查仅验证 TCP 监听；worker 注册成功和 KV 操作将在第 5.4.5 节中验证。"

msgid ""
"2. Start the first A3 Decode node (global DP ranks 0–3). Use the pooled "
"`run_decode_d1.sh`, not the normal-PD script:"
msgstr ""
"2. 启动第一个 A3 Decode 节点（全局 DP rank 0–3）。使用池化的 `run_decode_d1.sh`，而不是普通 PD 脚本："

msgid ""
"Wait for rank 0 to print `Started DP Coordinator process`. Start the second "
"node from another shell; initialization needs both D nodes."
msgstr ""
"等待 rank 0 打印 `Started DP Coordinator process`。从另一个 shell 启动第二个节点；初始化需要两个 D "
"节点。"

msgid ""
"On 950DT products, start one pooled Decode process on each Decode host "
"instead of one process per rank. D1 serves local DP ranks 0–1 and D2 serves "
"local DP ranks 2–3; start both before waiting, because the distributed group"
" needs both hosts:"
msgstr ""
"在 Ascend 950DT系列产品上，在每台 Decode 主机上启动一个池化 Decode 进程，而不是每个 rank 一个进程。D1 服务本地 "
"DP rank 0–1，D2 服务本地 DP rank 2–3；请在等待前启动两者，因为分布式组需要两台主机："

msgid ""
"Both hosts expose API port `31060`. Then skip step 3 on 950DT products."
msgstr "两台主机均暴露 API 端口 `31060`。然后在 Ascend 950DT系列产品上跳过步骤 3。"

msgid ""
"3. Start the second A3 Decode node (global DP ranks 4–7; A3 only). "
"`LOCAL_IP` is the second node's IP, but `DECODE_HEAD_IP` remains the first "
"Decode node's IP:"
msgstr ""
"3. 启动第二个 A3 Decode 节点（全局 DP rank 4–7；仅 A3）。`LOCAL_IP` 是第二个节点的 IP，但 "
"`DECODE_HEAD_IP` 仍为第一个 Decode 节点的 IP："

msgid ""
"D1 exposes API ports `19200`–`19203`; D2 exposes `19300`–`19303`. Wait for "
"all eight DP ranks to print `Application startup complete`."
msgstr ""
"D1 暴露 API 端口 `19200`–`19203`；D2 暴露 `19300`–`19303`。等待所有八个 DP rank 打印 "
"`Application startup complete`。"

msgid "4. Start Prefill using the pooled `run_prefill.sh`:"
msgstr "4. 使用池化的 `run_prefill.sh` 启动 Prefill："

msgid ""
"Wait for Prefill to print `Application startup complete` on port `19100`."
msgstr "等待 Prefill 在端口 `19100` 上打印 `Application startup complete`。"

msgid ""
"On 950DT products, start the pooled Prefill with `nohup bash run_prefill.sh "
"> prefill.log 2>&1 &` and wait for `Application startup complete` on port "
"`31050`."
msgstr ""
"在 Ascend 950DT系列产品上，使用 `nohup bash run_prefill.sh > prefill.log 2>&1 &` 启动池化"
" Prefill，并等待端口 `31050` 上出现 `Application startup complete`。"

msgid ""
"5. Start the proxy. The A3 proxy registers one Prefill endpoint and eight "
"Decode endpoints. Use the unchanged `proxy_server.sh` from Section 5.3:"
msgstr ""
"5. 启动代理。A3 代理注册一个 Prefill 端点和八个 Decode 端点。使用第 5.3 节中未修改的 `proxy_server.sh`："

msgid ""
"The service is accessible at `<proxy_ip>:19080`; use this endpoint with "
"model name `minimax-m3.1-flash` in [Section 6](#6-functional-verification)."
msgstr ""
"服务可通过 `<proxy_ip>:19080` 访问；在[第 6 节](#6-functional-verification)中使用此端点及模型名称 "
"`minimax-m3.1-flash`。"

msgid ""
"On 950DT products, use the unchanged Section 5.3 950DT `proxy_server.sh`: it"
" registers one Prefill endpoint on `31050` and two Decode endpoints on "
"`31060`, and the pooled scripts keep those ports."
msgstr ""
"在 Ascend 950DT系列产品上，使用第 5.3 节 950DT 中未修改的 `proxy_server.sh`：它在 `31050` 上注册一个"
" Prefill 端点，在 `31060` 上注册两个 Decode 端点，池化脚本保持这些端口不变。"

msgid "#### 5.4.5 Verification"
msgstr "#### 5.4.5 验证"

msgid ""
"1. Confirm Mooncake Master port `50088` is reachable, Master runs with `--enable_offload=true`, and every node uses the same Master address and `tenant_id`. Confirm the Prefill and Decode nodes load the `global_segment_size` from their `mooncake.json` (`4GB` on A3, `64GB` on 950DT products). Check worker logs for successful segment registration.\n"
"2. Confirm every Decode engine port is ready, then every Prefill engine port. A3 has nine APIs (one P plus eight D); 950DT products have three (one Prefill on `31050` and two Decode on `31060`).\n"
"3. Send requests only to the proxy on port `19080`.\n"
"4. Warm up with a repeated-prefix request, then send again and check Prefill logs for KV Pool lookup/get/put and hit information.\n"
"5. Confirm Decode logs still show a normal Mooncake P→D KV transfer.\n"
"6. Confirm SSD storage initializes under `ssd_offload_path` for each contributing worker. Use a working set larger than the memory pool to verify SSD offload and subsequent reads; a memory-pool hit alone does not exercise the SSD tier."
msgstr ""
"1. 确认 Mooncake Master 端口 `50088` 可达，Master 以 `--enable_offload=true` 运行，且每个节点使用相同的 Master 地址和 `tenant_id`。确认 Prefill 和 Decode 节点从各自的 `mooncake.json` 加载 `global_segment_size`（A3 上为 `4GB`，Ascend 950DT系列产品上为 `64GB`）。检查 worker 日志以确认 segment 注册成功。\n"
"2. 确认每个 Decode 引擎端口就绪，然后确认每个 Prefill 引擎端口就绪。A3 有九个 API（一个 P 加八个 D）；Ascend 950DT系列产品有三个（一个 Prefill 在 `31050`，两个 Decode 在 `31060`）。\n"
"3. 仅向端口 `19080` 上的代理发送请求。\n"
"4. 使用重复前缀请求进行预热，然后再次发送，并检查 Prefill 日志中的 KV Pool 查找/获取/写入及命中信息。\n"
"5. 确认 Decode 日志仍显示正常的 Mooncake P→D KV 传输。\n"
"6. 确认每个参与贡献的 worker 在 `ssd_offload_path` 下初始化 SSD 存储。使用大于内存池的工作集来验证 SSD 卸载及后续读取；仅命中内存池并不能验证 SSD 层级。"

msgid "### 5.5 1M-Token Context Deployment"
msgstr "### 5.5 1M Token 上下文部署"

msgid ""
"This text-only W8A8 profile uses a 1P1D topology: one Prefill service on one"
" host and one distributed Decode service spanning two hosts. The two Decode "
"hosts share one global DP4 × TP8 × PP1 group. All three hosts are Atlas 800I"
" A3 machines, each with 16 visible 64 GB NPU devices. Here, 1M means "
"**1,048,576 input tokens**. The total context limit is `1050624`, reserving "
"2048 positions for generation; the verification request below caps "
"generation at 256 tokens. Use the model image and W8A8 checkpoint from "
"Sections 3 and 4 on every node. The validated runtime uses vLLM 0.32.0, "
"torch_npu 2.10.0.post7, and CANN 9.2.0, with the M3.1 operators and "
"selected-parameter prefetch options shown below available in the image."
msgstr ""
"此纯文本 W8A8 配置采用 1P1D 拓扑：一台主机上运行一个 Prefill 服务，一个分布式 Decode 服务跨两台主机。两台 Decode "
"主机共享一个全局 DP4 × TP8 × PP1 组。三台主机均为 Atlas 800I A3 机器，每台有 16 个可见的 64 GB NPU "
"设备。此处 1M 表示 **1,048,576 个输入 token**。总上下文限制为 `1050624`，为生成保留 2048 "
"个位置；下面的验证请求将生成限制为 256 个 token。在每个节点上使用第 3 节和第 4 节中的模型镜像和 W8A8 权重。经验证的运行时使用 "
"vLLM 0.32.0、torch_npu 2.10.0.post7 和 CANN 9.2.0，镜像中提供了下文所示的 M3.1 "
"算子及选定参数预取选项。"

msgid ""
"| Host | Global DP / TP / PP | Local DP ranks | API ports | Batched-token "
"budget |"
msgstr "| 主机 | 全局 DP / TP / PP | 本地 DP rank | API 端口 | 批处理 token 预算 |"

msgid ""
"This is a functional long-context configuration with one sequence per Decode"
" replica. Both roles use eager execution, Model Runner V2, BF16 KV caches, "
"and chunked prefill. Speculative decoding, prefix caching, asynchronous "
"scheduling, and static kernels are disabled. The batched-token budget limits"
" each iteration; it does not limit the total input length."
msgstr ""
"这是一个可用的长上下文配置，每个 Decode 副本处理一个序列。两种角色均使用 eager 执行、Model Runner V2、BF16 KV "
"缓存和分块 prefill。推测解码、前缀缓存、异步调度和静态内核均已禁用。批处理 token 预算限制每次迭代；它不限制总输入长度。"

msgid ""
"Decode reserves `48421142528` bytes (about 45.1 GiB) of KV cache per worker."
" To retain workspace for the attention operators, it prefetches router and "
"attention-projection weights from CPU using `gate.weight`, "
"`qkv_proj.weight`, and `o_proj.weight`. Other weights remain on NPU. Decode "
"uses `weight_nz_mode=0` so the selected projection weights use ordinary "
"layouts for prefetching. Allow for these CPU-to-NPU transfers when "
"evaluating latency; tune performance separately."
msgstr ""
"Decode 为每个 worker 预留 `48421142528` 字节（约 45.1 GiB）的 KV 缓存。为给注意力算子保留工作空间，它使用 "
"`gate.weight`、`qkv_proj.weight` 和 `o_proj.weight` 从 CPU 预取路由和注意力投影权重。其他权重保留在"
" NPU 上。Decode 使用 `weight_nz_mode=0`，使选定的投影权重使用普通布局以便预取。评估延迟时需考虑这些 CPU 到 NPU "
"的传输；性能需单独调优。"

